  "version": 1,
  "meta": {
    "author": "eta",
    "updated": "2026-02-18T12:00:00Z",
    "notes": [
      "Steampunk dwarven palette emphasizing brass/copper metals, controlled cyan/amethyst crystals, and deep slate terrain.",
      "Dark slate panels for HUD; parchment-toned inverted panels for overlays/tooltips; accents avoid UI glare.",
      "Telegraph arcs tuned to Gamma semantics: amber (attention), red (danger), green (parry/future).",
      "Minimap colors separated for 1px readability at 3x–4x scale: rock vs floor vs ore clearly distinct; player bright, enemy distinct.",
      "Lighting helpers balance warm lamp glow with cold cave ambient; effects include neutral hit flash and ore-colored sparks.",
      "Contrast audit pending; target ratios listed in docs/visual-systems/style-guide.md"
    ]
  },
